  "updateinfo_id": "ALSA-2026:99051",
  "description": ".NET is a fast, lightweight and modular platform for creating cross platform applications that work on Linux, macOS and Windows. It particularly focuses on creating console applications, web applications and micro-services. .NET contains a runtime conforming to .NET Standards a set of framework libraries, an SDK containing compilers and a 'dotnet' application to drive everything.  \n\nSDK version: 9.0.124  \nRuntime version: 9.0.23  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * dotnet8.0: dotnet11.0: dotnet9.0: dotnet10.0: ASP.NET Core Information Disclosure Vulnerability (CVE-2026-109476)\n  * dotnet11.0: dotnet10.0: dotnet9.0: dotnet8.0: .NET Elevation of Privilege Vulnerability (CVE-2026-105544)\n  * dotnet8.0: dotnet9.0: dotnet11.0: dotnet10.0: .NET Denial of Service Vulnerability (CVE-2026-109475)\n  * dotnet9.0: dotnet11.0: dotnet10.0: dotnet8.0: dotnet: ASP.NET Core Elevation of Privilege Vulnerability (CVE-2026-114146)\n  * dotnet11.0: dotnet8.0: dotnet9.0: dotnet10.0: ASP.NET Core Denial of Service Vulnerability (CVE-2026-114147)\n  * dotnet11.0: dotnet8.0: dotnet9.0: dotnet10.0: ASP.NET Core Denial of Service Vulnerability (CVE-2026-114149)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * Update .NET 9.0 to SDK 9.0.124 and Runtime 9.0.23 (JIRA:RHEL-302540)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
  "fromstr": "packager@almalinux.org",
